  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Shows G A M E   O V E R in the status line and waits."},
    {"at":15,"placement":"line","text":"Waits a fixed time. Fire of the next player ends the wait early. In an intermission, it reads the fire of the same player."},
    {"at":48,"placement":"line","text":"Blinks OUT OF TIME with the saved status line 20 times, or until fire is pressed."},
    {"at":104,"placement":"line","text":"For an intermission, shows B O N U S  L I F E and adds a life. Else shows the player line."},
    {"at":144,"placement":"line","text":"Runs after a life or a cave ends: shows out of time, game over or the next cave text. Then it clears the screen."},
    {"at":144,"placement":"side","text":"The clock reached the time of the cave."},
    {"at":156,"placement":"side","text":"Shows 0 in the last time digit on the screen."},
    {"at":173,"placement":"side","text":"Resets the magic wall graphics."}
  ],
